      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MERIMBULA (2) is the horse to beat after closing strongly for third behind Press Express in a BM54 at this track, despite missing the start and giving himself work to do. The move to BM58 is a genuine class rise, but he has already won around 1600m, owns a sound record at this venue and comes through Saturday company into an easier meeting. I'M A DREAMER (4) is the main danger on track-and-distance credentials, with four wins and three placings from 14 attempts under these conditions and a 2kg apprentice claim to help offset the step from BM54 grade. SASS (5) brings the most reliable recent finishing pattern, having won from Tee Galleria before running second to Debating, and her 1600m placing record keeps her strongly in the mix. CHARLIE MAGIC (7) first go at 1600m and blinkers go on. Could sneak into a place.",
